        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Steel or Aluminum Frame Mortise Hook Deadbolt Lockset for Sliding Store Front Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sliding Storefront Door Mortise Hook Deadbolt Lockset contains everything you need in one kit. The hookbolt mortise lock body is designed for sliding aluminum or steel framed doors. A huge, five-ply, laminated steel hook bolt that has concealed hardened steel pin provides maximum security. The kit also includes a zinc cylinder, trim ring, face plate, and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non handed, easily reversible</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate: Width - 1\", Length - 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: Width - 7/8\",  Length -  6\", Depth (specific to backset) - 1.63\" through 1.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Width - 5/8\", Throw - 15/16”</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis complete mortise deadbolt set with zinc cylinder is available in <b>Single Cylinder</b> (keyed lock outside with thumbturn inside) or <b>Double Cylinder</b> (keyed lock on both the outside and inside). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>TH1102-PZSC</b> - Zinc Single Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt Set:\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/1-inch-zinc-mortise-cylinder-lock-th1100-zc\">Zinc Cylinder Lock</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-cylinder-zinc-thumbturn-th1100-zt\">Zinc Thumbturn</a></li> \r\n<li>Pair of 3/16\" Spacer/Trim Rings</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\">Hookbolt Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-hookbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp6-10\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>TH1102-PZDC:</b> - Zinc Double Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt Set \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/1-inch-zinc-mortise-cylinder-lock-th1100-zc\">Pair of Zinc Cylinder Locks (keyed alike)</a></li> \r\n<li>Pair of 3/16\" Spacer/Trim Rings</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\">Hookbolt Mortise Deadbolt Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-hookbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp6-10\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish for cylinders and trim. When ordering more than 1 set, you can have them Keyed Differently or Keyed Alike (same key for all sets).\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sliding Storefront Door Mortise Deadbolt Lockset, Zinc Cylinders, TH1102-PZ",
                "description": "Steel or aluminum frame sliding entry door Mortise Deadbolt Lock Sets - Mortise Hook Deadbolt Lock Sets with Zinc Cylinders for sliding store front doors. Available as single or double cylinders in both Aluminum or Dark Bronze trim finish.",
